{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o023b","title":"甄氏去世","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o023b-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"甄氏去世","evidence":["wendi-e-o023b-q"]},{"id":"houfei-e-o020c-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"黄初二年六月：曹丕遣使赐甄氏死葬邺","evidence":["houfei-e-o020c-q"]},{"id":"houfei-e-p013a-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"夏六月丁卯：魏书称甄氏三让后位未赴行在病崩赠玺绶","evidence":["houfei-e-p013a-q"]},{"id":"houfei-a-p014-judgment","label":"裴松之论","text":"夏六月丁卯：裴松之以文帝不立甄氏且加杀害事有明审，斥魏书假辞崇饰；并疑卞甄善行难以实论。","evidence":["houfei-q-p014-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0016","role":"去世","evidence":["wendi-e-o023b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"赐死","evidence":["houfei-e-o020c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":221,"label":"黄初二年六月丁卯","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y221","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o019","basis":"黄初二年六月丁卯"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o023b-q","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o023b-q","source_order":[2,232,"O023b"],"order":580}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0016","name":"甄氏","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o020c-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-dd2adf33c3625f91bf58","layer":"original","quote":"延康元年正月，文帝即王位。六月，南征，后留邺。黄初元年十月，帝践阼。践阼之后，山阳公奉二女以嫔于魏，郭后、李、阴贵人，并爱幸；后愈失意，有怨言，帝大怒。二年六月〖8〗，遣使赐死；葬于邺。﹝四﹞","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-e-p013a-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-0a37ae100eada4c50f4b","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《魏书》曰：“有司奏建长秋宫，帝玺书迎后，诣行在所。后上表曰：‘妾闻先代之兴，所以飨国久长，垂祚后嗣，无不由后妃焉；故必审选其人，以兴内教。今践阼之初，诚宜登进贤淑，统理六宫。妾自省愚陋，不任粢盛之事；加以寝疾，敢守微志。’玺书三至，而后三让，言甚恳切。时盛暑，帝欲须秋凉，乃更迎后。会后疾遂笃，夏六月丁卯，崩于邺。帝哀痛咨嗟，策赠皇后玺绶。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":91,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-06798b65f9c62301b5ea","start":0,"end":175,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-p014-judgment","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-c822db645f828823e101","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以为：《春秋》之义，“内：大恶讳，小恶（不）书”。文帝之不立甄氏，及加杀害，事有明审。魏史若以为大恶邪，则宜隐而不言；若谓为小恶邪，则不应假为之辞。而崇饰虚文乃至于是，异乎所闻于旧史。推此而言，其称卞、甄诸后言行之善，皆难以实论；陈氏删落，良有以也。","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":92,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-06798b65f9c62301b5ea","start":0,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-o023b-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-b6c7fa1367a90722fd81","layer":"original","quote":"丁卯〖23〗，夫人甄氏卒〖24〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":231,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":29,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
